tion`, `.hcfg`-family combos, byte/array/binary/xor/blob rejected; see single_solve/HELP.md.\n\n## Proposed lib additions\n- lib/vocab.json: storage / hcfg_storage = \"base64\" for a base64 (SENGR...) stored HCFG (GM D17 d09/d08/d11/d13); \"raw\" REJECTED for raw-stored (D17 d12/d14).\n\nVARIANT AXIS: (speed cycle, no code change, D17) the \"3.31 s on single_solve\" flag was measured under load (load avg ~4.5; harness cProfile counted ~1.1 s of imports and ~2.4 s of thread waits) -- isolated: solve.py 0.8-0.9 s wall on the 204-id single (run_solver 0.87 s; tottime is 0.24 s threaded zlib inflate of the AES members + ~0.2 s imports), 1.1 s inside the full concurrent solver-test; all 31 cases green. `hctf solver-run` wall (~6.5 s) is CLI/harness startup under load, not the solver. d12/d14 `hcfg_storage` (raw-stored) stay intentionally empty (unresolved GM label), so the single outputs 202/204.\n  206 reference/techniques/binary-reverse-engineering.md\n  198 reference/coverage/binary-reverse-engineering.md\n  404 total","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_019ag7vqyLn2xBeykdGyfi84","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
