add cl, 1`; no constant key | [I] capstone on the decode fn; brute 256x few modes on known plaintext `HCFG` | med |\n| 55 | Stack-built / code-built blob (mov imm to stack, per-char pushes) | prebuilt (stack-built-hcfg; floss installed) | runs of `mov dword [rbp-0x..], imm32` / `movabs rax, imm64; mov [rsp+..], rax`; no blob bytes contiguous in rodata | [I] unicorn/angr emulate the builder fn; capstone imm collection; [M] FLOSS (`floss --only stack tight f`) | med-high (classic CTF \"no strings\" follow-up to \"Stripped\") |\n| 56 | Resources: PE RT_RCDATA, .NET manifest resource, jar non-class file, Mach-O section | prebuilt (resource-overlay-hcfg) | `.rsrc` RCDATA named `HCFG`/`CONFIG`; .NET `ManifestResource` table; jar `config.bin` | [I] python `pefile` `DIRECTORY_ENTRY_RESOURCE`; `dnfile` resources; `unzip -p f.jar config.bin`; `llvm-otool -s __DATA __hcfg f` | med (a resource is the PE twin of `.hcfg`; offset convention unconfirmed) |\n| 57 | Overlay (bytes after last section / appended) | prebuilt (resource-overlay-hcfg) | file size > max(section end); `binwalk` hit past EOF of image | [I] python `pefile` `get_overlay_data_start_offset()`; ELF: max(sh_offset+sh_size) vs size | med (raw scan already finds a raw/b64 overlay; a `has_overlay`/`overlay_offset` field would be new) |\n| 58 | Init-time decoding: TLS callbacks, `.init_array` / constructors, `DllMain` | prebuilt (init-time-decoder) | PE TLS dir `AddressOfCallBacks`; ELF `.init_array` entries beyond frame_dummy | [I] `readelf -x .init_array f`; `objdump -p f.exe \\| grep -A5 TLS` | low-med |\n| 59 | Exotic encodings: base58/62/91, z85, lz4/zstd/brotli | prebuilt (exotic-codecs) | b58 alphabet (no 0OIl), `<~` vs z85, lz4 frame `04 22 4d 18`, zstd `28 b5 2f fd` | [I] `tools/pybase62`, `tools/pybase91`, python `lz4`; [M] python `zstandard`, `brotli` | low-med |\n| 60 | Entry point + function constant (`disassembly`, recover_code) | seen D1 (entry), D1/D8/D15 (disassembly) | `e_entry` / `AddressOfEntryPoint